(6506981, 966679, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is real good because it is very hard to photograph 2D objects well. You have managed to show some depth which is a great feat. The light is even which is good. I do think the sand timer is a little misplaced and doesn''t really belong as it is not an artifact or an heirloom in my opinion. (perhaps it belonged to someone special in your family, I do not know.) Something more personal like a pocket watch would have worked well.</td>', 'This is real good because it is very hard to photograph 2D objects well. You have managed to show some depth which is a great feat. The light is even which is good. I do think the sand timer is a little misplaced and doesn''t really belong as it is not an artifact or an heirloom in my opinion. (perhaps it belonged to someone special in your family, I do not know.) Something more personal like a pocket watch would have worked well.', '2011-08-17 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
