(6507232, 967801, 118154, '<td valign="top">A little ott with the color and contrast for me but a good time shot.7.</td>', 'A little ott with the color and contrast for me but a good time shot.7.', '2011-08-17 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507242, 967197, 10785, '<td valign="top">Fugit Abatit...<br/> <br/>The two different lighting types conflict but you processed them nicely. I think the girl is stuck too far in the corner. It would have been nicer to recompose to put her in the third.</td>', 'Fugit Abatit... The two different lighting types conflict but you processed them nicely. I think the girl is stuck too far in the corner. It would have been nicer to recompose to put her in the third.', '2011-08-17 14:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507248, 967663, 83184, '<td valign="top">Awesome quotation, awesome image. Well done!</td>', 'Awesome quotation, awesome image. Well done!', '2011-08-17 14:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507249, 967061, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did really well capturing the color and detail of the flame but the message is a bit lost in the scale of the subject (ie. a small match verses a large torch or something of that sort). I would like to see some light on the hand. It would also have been nice to see another hand accepting the flame. you did really well using the rule of thirds on this!</td>', 'You did really well capturing the color and detail of the flame but the message is a bit lost in the scale of the subject (ie. a small match verses a large torch or something of that sort). I would like to see some light on the hand. It would also have been nice to see another hand accepting the flame. you did really well using the rule of thirds on this!', '2011-08-17 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507250, 967725, 71657, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but fits the subject...would have like to see a little more dof...really good shot though  8</td>', 'A little dark, but fits the subject...would have like to see a little more dof...really good shot though  8', '2011-08-17 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507252, 967816, 71657, '<td valign="top">nice  flash is a little distracting in the clock face but otherwise nice...7</td>', 'nice  flash is a little distracting in the clock face but otherwise nice...7', '2011-08-17 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507256, 967753, 71657, '<td valign="top">nice clean  7</td>', 'nice clean  7', '2011-08-17 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507258, 967680, 71657, '<td valign="top">nice watch</td>', 'nice watch', '2011-08-17 14:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507261, 967730, 10785, '<td valign="top">Such a well executed concept. So many elements make this great for the challenge. The look on the person''s face, them looking at their watch, their feet off the ground suggesting their hurried movement, the tight alleyway leading to the other person hurrying up behind them. Even though the shutter speed didn''t allow for the capture of blurred movement, movement is portrayed well! The B&amp;W and the street photography genre all add up to give this a 10.0</td>', 'Such a well executed concept. So many elements make this great for the challenge. The look on the person''s face, them looking at their watch, their feet off the ground suggesting their hurried movement, the tight alleyway leading to the other person hurrying up behind them. Even though the shutter speed didn''t allow for the capture of blurred movement, movement is portrayed well! The B&W and the street photography genre all add up to give this a 10.0', '2011-08-17 14:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
