(6507324, 967692, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity of the cups and the spoons to show a clock.  I''m not sure about the red light painting to outline the clock though... Don''t know if another device would have been better or the light painting left out.  However, upon a longer look, the light painting does give an impression of steam (when one thinks of coffee), with the light fading at towards the top.  None the less, a well done shot.</td>', 'I like the creativity of the cups and the spoons to show a clock.  I''m not sure about the red light painting to outline the clock though... Don''t know if another device would have been better or the light painting left out.  However, upon a longer look, the light painting does give an impression of steam (when one thinks of coffee), with the light fading at towards the top.  None the less, a well done shot.', '2011-08-17 14:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
