(6508421, 967744, 10785, '<td valign="top">Another good take of a similar subject. I kind of like the brighter light on the other picture. But the muted colors here are cool. I do like the other photo using the rule of thirds better than this one which has filled more of the frame with the subject. Good job on the textures and I like the gradient sky!</td>', 'Another good take of a similar subject. I kind of like the brighter light on the other picture. But the muted colors here are cool. I do like the other photo using the rule of thirds better than this one which has filled more of the frame with the subject. Good job on the textures and I like the gradient sky!', '2011-08-18 16:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
