(6509327, 967730, 132251, '<td valign="top">She is COMPLETELY off the ground! I like the lighting coming from up the alley, did you use a fill flash to light up the front of her, or was there enough?</td>', 'She is COMPLETELY off the ground! I like the lighting coming from up the alley, did you use a fill flash to light up the front of her, or was there enough?', '2011-08-19 10:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
