(6509747, 967745, 103032, '<td valign="top">Love the technique of long exposure showing the movement of the people.  I think this photo has many elements of time; the motion blur, the clock, the train [running on time :) ].  Lots to explore in the shot.  Like the B&amp;W too.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Love the technique of long exposure showing the movement of the people.  I think this photo has many elements of time; the motion blur, the clock, the train [running on time :) ].  Lots to explore in the shot.  Like the B&W too.  One of my top picks.', '2011-08-19 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509754, 967778, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nicely orchestrated/composed photo.  I really like how the photograph is surrounded by the model.  I usually don''t pay that much attention to titles, but it is fitting with the model''s expression; kind of sad/solemn/reflective...  Your post processing is a statement too in that the slightly desat reflects the "time fading" (if that makes sense), but maybe I''m reading too much into it.  Then again, that''s what makes this a great photo, it tells a story...</td>', 'Nicely orchestrated/composed photo.  I really like how the photograph is surrounded by the model.  I usually don''t pay that much attention to titles, but it is fitting with the model''s expression; kind of sad/solemn/reflective...  Your post processing is a statement too in that the slightly desat reflects the "time fading" (if that makes sense), but maybe I''m reading too much into it.  Then again, that''s what makes this a great photo, it tells a story...', '2011-08-19 17:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6509758, 967579, 103032, '<td valign="top">A cool effect. Creative combining a clock with an hourglass concept.  You''ll have to put in your notes how you achieved this.</td>', 'A cool effect. Creative combining a clock with an hourglass concept.  You''ll have to put in your notes how you achieved this.', '2011-08-19 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
