(6510399, 967778, 47470, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the double reflection in this.  The reflections paired with her expression are amazing.<br/> <br/>The one part that I don''t like is the color treatment.  The dull, yellow-tinted colors give the impression that old age is dirty and sickly.  I haven''t tried to convert this into black and white, but I think that that would have given more of a nostalgic feeling, which I think would fit better with her expressed emotion.  I think she still looks great--just nostalgic.</td>', 'I absolutely love the double reflection in this.  The reflections paired with her expression are amazing. The one part that I don''t like is the color treatment.  The dull, yellow-tinted colors give the impression that old age is dirty and sickly.  I haven''t tried to convert this into black and white, but I think that that would have given more of a nostalgic feeling, which I think would fit better with her expressed emotion.  I think she still looks great--just nostalgic.', '2011-08-20 16:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
