(6513107, 967727, 137358, '<td valign="top">Very sharp detailing in a lot of areas, nice atempt at a daliesque image. There are areas around the lower item on the clock face that seem to be bleeting in to the face marginaly reducing the clarity. <br/>Overall a well presented image</td>', 'Very sharp detailing in a lot of areas, nice atempt at a daliesque image. There are areas around the lower item on the clock face that seem to be bleeting in to the face marginaly reducing the clarity. Overall a well presented image', '2011-08-23 16:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6513109, 967175, 137358, '<td valign="top">It may be my monitor but the overall image of the rope and glass seems too dark for detail. The knot on the rope is lacking clarity bacause of this. Shame really as the concept is unusual and worth working on.<br/>The crisp lines show good focus, it may be post processing that has darkened the image</td>', 'It may be my monitor but the overall image of the rope and glass seems too dark for detail. The knot on the rope is lacking clarity bacause of this. Shame really as the concept is unusual and worth working on.The crisp lines show good focus, it may be post processing that has darkened the image', '2011-08-23 16:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6513113, 966973, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, bit long on the title but then I cant think of a way of shortening it either. The image is crisp and well saturated. the colours true to life. I like the Sharpness of the watch reflections. Very well presented, good luck.</td>', 'Nice concept, bit long on the title but then I cant think of a way of shortening it either. The image is crisp and well saturated. the colours true to life. I like the Sharpness of the watch reflections. Very well presented, good luck.', '2011-08-23 16:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6513115, 967740, 137358, '<td valign="top">Nice arangement. Good depth. Well done in getting different levels on the egg timers. The focus is crisp and well judged. The only quibble I have is the lighting of the leaf, it does not come from the candle which is the only light sourse in the image and detracts from the whole, despite this the golden colours of this leaf enhance the picture. good luck</td>', 'Nice arangement. Good depth. Well done in getting different levels on the egg timers. The focus is crisp and well judged. The only quibble I have is the lighting of the leaf, it does not come from the candle which is the only light sourse in the image and detracts from the whole, despite this the golden colours of this leaf enhance the picture. good luck', '2011-08-23 16:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6513117, 967677, 137358, '<td valign="top">Good use of two colour presentation and nice concept.<br/>I fint the radium luminescence a bit blown on the smaller handles and towards the bottom of the main handles. The clarity is excellent. well done</td>', 'Good use of two colour presentation and nice concept.I fint the radium luminescence a bit blown on the smaller handles and towards the bottom of the main handles. The clarity is excellent. well done', '2011-08-23 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
