(6513219, 967742, 67258, '<td valign="top">Yes, you have definitely achieved a timeless image - this could have been taken today, ten years ago, 100, years ago, 200 years ago, and more, and little would have changed - the plaster work newer and fresher perhaps.  Quite rare for a landscape of an entirely man made environment.<br/> <br/>Back to bump.</td>', 'Yes, you have definitely achieved a timeless image - this could have been taken today, ten years ago, 100, years ago, 200 years ago, and more, and little would have changed - the plaster work newer and fresher perhaps.  Quite rare for a landscape of an entirely man made environment. Back to bump.', '2011-08-23 18:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6513266, 967151, 82545, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this picture as well as the subject matter. However, the HDR is blown way out for my taste. I assume that this was taken in a fully sunny day with a lot of light, I''d really like to see you take this shot again on a cloudy day to allow a lot more contrast without blowing out the colors.</td>', 'I like the framing of this picture as well as the subject matter. However, the HDR is blown way out for my taste. I assume that this was taken in a fully sunny day with a lot of light, I''d really like to see you take this shot again on a cloudy day to allow a lot more contrast without blowing out the colors.', '2011-08-23 20:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
