(6513884, 967687, 133158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EL-ROI:</b></div><hr/><i> Waar gingen alle migranten? Pasten zij allen op schaven? Waarom maakte dit u uw hoofd raken? Ik heb zo vele vragen verlaten onbeantwoord.<br/> <br/>Where did all the migrants go? Did they all fit on the one plane? Why did this make you hit your head? I have so many questions left unanswered. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was not my purpose to provoke something here, the article that you see was been read at that moment, i did not choose to shoot it. Now I realise that details matter, just did not taught it would make a problem because it was in Dutch. Sorry for the misunderstanding..</td>', 'Originally posted by EL-ROI: Waar gingen alle migranten? Pasten zij allen op schaven? Waarom maakte dit u uw hoofd raken? Ik heb zo vele vragen verlaten onbeantwoord. Where did all the migrants go? Did they all fit on the one plane? Why did this make you hit your head? I have so many questions left unanswered.   It was not my purpose to provoke something here, the article that you see was been read at that moment, i did not choose to shoot it. Now I realise that details matter, just did not taught it would make a problem because it was in Dutch. Sorry for the misunderstanding..', '2011-08-24 05:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
