(6514139, 967707, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Atilla the Hahn:</b></div><hr/><i>The people who don''t see this as a good "Time" challenge entry do not have much imagination nor sense of history. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Really, Richard? Every time you enter something that is a stretch for the challenge topic, you <i>insult</i> the voters who don''t see things exactly the way you do? Grow up.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png"/> <br/> <br/>By the way, I do think it is a spectacular photo.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png"/> <br/> <br/>...also, I checked the appropriate boxes for you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No need to call me names.  Regarding rugman and kskidmore, I promised a SC member more than a year ago that I would always ignore their comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Originally posted by Atilla the Hahn:The people who don''t see this as a good "Time" challenge entry do not have much imagination nor sense of history.  Really, Richard? Every time you enter something that is a stretch for the challenge topic, you insult the voters who don''t see things exactly the way you do? Grow up.  By the way, I do think it is a spectacular photo.  ...also, I checked the appropriate boxes for you.  No need to call me names.  Regarding rugman and kskidmore, I promised a SC member more than a year ago that I would always ignore their comments.', '2011-08-24 09:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
