(6515161, 967131, 93565, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were getting at, the idea behind your shot. It''s unfortunate that you got a DQ on your first entry, but it happens. Make sure to read the rulesets carefully- they can be confusing, so feel free to ask me if you have any questions about them. I''ve been around here for a fair bit and can hopefully answer any questions you can throw my way.</td>', 'I understand what you were getting at, the idea behind your shot. It''s unfortunate that you got a DQ on your first entry, but it happens. Make sure to read the rulesets carefully- they can be confusing, so feel free to ask me if you have any questions about them. I''ve been around here for a fair bit and can hopefully answer any questions you can throw my way.', '2011-08-25 03:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
