(6516121, 967707, 39057, '<td valign="top">I wish you would just ignore me. Why did you drag me into the Rugman and/or Art''s comment? I gave your photo a SIX....your mode average. I made DNMC comments to many images to add some fun to the challenge.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=969358" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_969358.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_969358.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_969358.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Atilla the Hahn:</b></div><hr/><i>The people who don''t see this as a good "Time" challenge entry do not have much imagination nor sense of history. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Really, Richard? Every time you enter something that is a stretch for the challenge topic, you <i>insult</i> the voters who don''t see things exactly the way you do? Grow up.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_not_helpful.png"/> <br/> <br/>By the way, I do think it is a spectacular photo.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/comment_helpful.png"/> <br/> <br/>...also, I checked the appropriate boxes for you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No need to call me names.  Regarding rugman and kskidmore, I promised a SC member more than a year ago that I would always ignore their comments. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-27 23:04:57.</i></td>', 'I wish you would just ignore me. Why did you drag me into the Rugman and/or Art''s comment? I gave your photo a SIX....your mode average. I made DNMC comments to many images to add some fun to the challenge.   Originally posted by hahn23: Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Originally posted by Atilla the Hahn:The people who don''t see this as a good "Time" challenge entry do not have much imagination nor sense of history.  Really, Richard? Every time you enter something that is a stretch for the challenge topic, you insult the voters who don''t see things exactly the way you do? Grow up.  By the way, I do think it is a spectacular photo.  ...also, I checked the appropriate boxes for you.  No need to call me names.  Regarding rugman and kskidmore, I promised a SC member more than a year ago that I would always ignore their comments. ', '2011-08-26 00:11:01.000000', '2011-08-28 00:04:57.000000', 0),
