(6517450, 967695, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh!  Splendid!  And finished at 122/126, so you <i>know</i> that it''s really good!  Ik versta u als u langzaam praat, Jan!</td>', 'Ahhhh!  Splendid!  And finished at 122/126, so you know that it''s really good!  Ik versta u als u langzaam praat, Jan!', '2011-08-27 13:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
