(6520976, 967579, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great idea, fantastic image and a definite wall-hanger. Congrats on your ribbon, Alessandro.</td>', 'Great idea, fantastic image and a definite wall-hanger. Congrats on your ribbon, Alessandro.', '2011-08-30 15:00:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6526541, 967685, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is such an amusing shot, so filled with life ...<br/>I keep rearranging mentally the elements - what if the line of the tray would have been pulled just so little as to lineup with the vertical line of the black background .... What if the eggcup would move up a notch .... I can picture it turning into a great decorative pattern. Lovely, lovely shot.</td>', 'This is such an amusing shot, so filled with life ...I keep rearranging mentally the elements - what if the line of the tray would have been pulled just so little as to lineup with the vertical line of the black background .... What if the eggcup would move up a notch .... I can picture it turning into a great decorative pattern. Lovely, lovely shot.', '2011-09-03 18:00:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6531053, 966684, 113479, '<td valign="top">for the record I have no idea what those numbers meant. I understand very little about that stuff. although I love to do photography I am far from knowing everything I am still learning about things on my camera and simply that is why my photo got disqualified from this contest because I didn''t change my dates to the correct ones.</td>', 'for the record I have no idea what those numbers meant. I understand very little about that stuff. although I love to do photography I am far from knowing everything I am still learning about things on my camera and simply that is why my photo got disqualified from this contest because I didn''t change my dates to the correct ones.', '2011-09-07 02:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
